<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-grid">
    <div>
      <img class="footer-logo" src="/images/logo.webp" alt="小牧人羊奶" width="130" height="84" loading="lazy" />
      <p>致力於提供最純淨、健康的羊奶產品，把牧場的溫度傳遞給每個家庭。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="/news/">最新消息</a>
      <a href="/milestones/">大事記</a>
      <a href="/products/">商品廚窗</a>
      <a href="/delivery/">配送方案</a>
      <a href="/line/">加入 Line</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container copyright">© 小牧人羊奶 Pastoral Harmony. All Rights Reserved.</div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(130, 117, 97, 0.14);
    background: rgba(245, 242, 234, 0.62);
    padding: 52px 0 28px;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 36px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    width: 120px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  p {
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(62, 54, 46, 0.72);
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 26px;
    color: rgba(62, 54, 46, 0.74);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary-strong);
  }

  .copyright {
    margin-top: 36px;
    color: rgba(62, 54, 46, 0.56);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .footer-links {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
